# Kraul Whipcracker {B}{G} (3/2, reach): "When this creature enters, destroy target token an opponent controls." Each player's
# Academy Instructor turns each noncreature spell (a free Mox) into an Officer token. The trigger has exactly one legal target, Bot2's Officer token, so it is chosen without a prompt and destroyed; Bot1's two
# Officer tokens and Bot2's nontoken Academy Instructor are not legal targets and survive (widening the filter would make a
# target prompt the script does not answer). The Whipcracker stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Academy Instructor
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Kraul Whipcracker
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Academy Instructor
Mox Jet
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Academy Instructor.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Academy Instructor.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Kraul Whipcracker.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Academy Instructor; Mox Jet; Mox Emerald; Kraul Whipcracker; Officer Token; Officer Token
Bot2.Battlefield = Island; Academy Instructor; Mox Jet
Bot1.Battlefield.Kraul Whipcracker.Power = 3
